  "resume": "This record documents a parliamentary question posed by National Councillor Bernhard Guhl during the 2015 spring session of the Swiss National Council, concerning whether federal authorities support the political activities of their employees within the militia system. It is part of the official session protocols and video recordings of the National Council. The question was addressed by Federal Councillor Eveline Widmer-Schlumpf."
